al fingers","Pole flip"],"keywords":"fingal fingers strongman","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Odd objects","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"commercial","description":"A row of hinged poles of increasing weight that you lift from horizontal and push over to the other side.","muscle_focus":["Glutes","Back","Shoulders","Triceps"],"loading":"Fixed weight","weight_options":"Poles 50–200 kg","adjustability":"Fixed per pole; some home versions are plate-loaded.","footprint":{"length_cm":400,"width_cm":300,"height_cm":250},"space":"XL","price_band":"$$$$","requires":[],"substitutes":["tyre"],"signature_exercises":["Fingal's fingers flip","Pole walk-up"],"exercise_ids":[],"buying_tips":"Rarely sold for home use; look for strongman gyms with one.","safety":"Walk the pole up in a straight line and step clear when it falls.","group_order":9,"sort_order":11},{"id":"framecarry","name":"Frame carry","aliases":["Farmer's frame","Carry frame"],"keywords":"frame carry strongman","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Carry implements","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"commercial","description":"A rectangular steel frame you stand inside and carry by two long side handles, loaded with plates.","muscle_focus":["Forearms","Traps","Core","Legs"],"loading":"Plate loaded","weight_options":"Frame 60–120 kg; loaded to 300+ kg","adjustability":"Fixed; plates on loading posts at each end.","footprint":{"length_cm":300,"width_cm":80,"height_cm":40},"space":"L","price_band":"$$$","requires":["plates"],"substitutes":["farmers","trapbar"],"signature_exercises":["Frame carry","Frame pick and hold","Frame deadlift"],"exercise_ids":[],"buying_tips":"Usually a competition piece; check the handle length fits your stride.","safety":"Keep the frame level and step with short, quick steps.","group_order":9,"sort_order":12},{"id":"husafell","name":"Husafell stone","aliases":["Odd-object stone","Carry stone","Natural stone"],"keywords":"husafell stone carry bear hug","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Stones","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"commercial","description":"A flat, awkward stone or steel replica hugged against the chest and carried for distance.","muscle_focus":["Upper back","Biceps","Core","Legs"],"loading":"Fixed weight","weight_options":"Steel replicas 100–180 kg","adjustability":"Fixed; steel versions can be plate-loaded.","footprint":{"length_cm":70,"width_cm":30,"height_cm":60},"space":"M","price_band":"$$$","requires":[],"substitutes":["sandbag","keg"],"signature_exercises":["Husafell stone carry","Bear-hug carry","Stone hold for time"],"exercise_ids":["sandcarry"],"buying_tips":"Plate-loaded steel versions are easier to store and adjust.","safety":"Lift it close to the body to protect the lower back.","group_order":9,"sort_order":13},{"id":"keg","name":"Keg","aliases":["Beer keg","Strongman keg"],"keywords":"keg carry toss","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Odd objects","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"both","description":"A steel beer keg filled with water or sand and lifted, carried, loaded or tossed.","muscle_focus":["Back","Biceps","Glutes","Shoulders"],"loading":"Adjustable (dial/pin)","weight_options":"Empty ~12 kg; filled 30–100+ kg","adjustability":"Change the weight by adding or removing water or sand.","footprint":{"length_cm":45,"width_cm":45,"height_cm":60},"space":"M","price_band":"$$","requires":[],"substitutes":["sandbag","atlasstone"],"signature_exercises":["Keg carry","Keg load","Keg toss","Keg clean and press"],"exercise_ids":[],"buying_tips":"Use an empty keg (not a deposit keg you must return); water sloshes, sand does not.","safety":"Check the caps are tight so it doesn't leak or burst.","group_order":9,"sort_order":14},{"id":"powerstairs","name":"Power stairs","aliases":["Duck walk implement","Stair implement"],"keywords":"power stairs duck walk","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Carry implements","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"commercial","description":"A 