hest and pressed overhead.","muscle_focus":["Shoulders","Triceps","Upper back","Core"],"loading":"Plate loaded","weight_options":"Logs 30–60 kg empty (8–12 in diameter)","adjustability":"Fixed diameter; choose 10 in or 12 in. Handles fixed.","footprint":{"length_cm":210,"width_cm":35,"height_cm":35},"space":"M","price_band":"$$$","requires":["plates"],"substitutes":["axlebar","barbell"],"signature_exercises":["Log clean and press","Log push press","Log clean","Log strict press"],"exercise_ids":["logpress"],"buying_tips":"Start with a 10 in log; check handle spacing and knurling. Fillable steel logs are cheaper.","safety":"Clean it with a belly roll and keep the elbows up so it doesn't crush the sternum.","group_order":9,"sort_order":17},{"id":"shield","name":"Strongman shield","aliases":["Shield carry","Strongman plate shield"],"keywords":"shield carry strongman","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Carry implements","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"commercial","description":"A large, flat steel shield hugged against the chest and carried for distance.","muscle_focus":["Upper back","Biceps","Core"],"loading":"Fixed weight","weight_options":"50–150 kg; some plate-loaded","adjustability":"Fixed or plate-loaded.","footprint":{"length_cm":100,"width_cm":20,"height_cm":90},"space":"M","price_band":"$$$","requires":[],"substitutes":["husafell","sandbag"],"signature_exercises":["Shield carry","Bear-hug hold"],"exercise_ids":[],"buying_tips":"Plate-loaded shields let you scale the load.","safety":"Keep it high on the chest so it doesn't hit your knees.","group_order":9,"sort_order":18},{"id":"tacky","name":"Strongman tacky","aliases":["Tacky","Stone tack","Pine tar grip"],"keywords":"tacky stone grip","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Accessories","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"both","description":"A sticky grip paste used on forearms and hands to hold atlas stones and other odd objects.","muscle_focus":["Grip"],"loading":"None (support/tool)","weight_options":"Tubs 50–300 g","adjustability":"","footprint":null,"space":"S","price_band":"$","requires":[],"substitutes":["chalk"],"signature_exercises":["Atlas stone load","Stone over bar","Keg load"],"exercise_ids":[],"buying_tips":"Many gyms ban it; buy one with a remover and check your gym's rules.","safety":"","group_order":9,"sort_order":19},{"id":"tyre","name":"Tyre","aliases":["Tire","Flip tyre","Tractor tyre"],"keywords":"tire tyre flip","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Odd objects","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"both","description":"A large truck or tractor tyre flipped end over end, or hit with a sledgehammer, for full-body power and conditioning.","muscle_focus":["Glutes","Hamstrings","Back","Chest","Triceps"],"loading":"Fixed weight","weight_options":"100–450+ kg (220–1000 lb); 1–2 m tall","adjustability":"Fixed; add chains or plates inside to make it heavier.","footprint":{"length_cm":180,"width_cm":180,"height_cm":40},"space":"L","price_band":"$$","requires":[],"substitutes":["sandbag","sled"],"signature_exercises":["Tyre flip","Tyre sledgehammer strikes","Tyre jumps","Tyre drag"],"exercise_ids":["tyreflip"],"buying_tips":"Farm and tyre shops often give used tyres away; choose one you can flip for at least a few reps.","safety":"Drive with hips and legs, not a rounded back, and never curl it up with straight arms.","group_order":9,"sort_order":20},{"id":"vikingpress","name":"Viking press","aliases":["Viking press station","Landmine viking press"],"keywords":"viking press overhead","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Pressing implements","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"both","description":"A lever-arm pressing station with two handles at the end, pressed overhead from shoulder height.","muscle_focus":["Shoulders","Triceps","Upper chest"],"loading":"Plate loaded","weight_options":"Arm plus plates; ~20–300 kg","adjustability":"Many have adjustable handle height or swap-in handles.","footprint":{"length_cm":200,"width_cm":80,"height_cm":170},"space":"L","price_band":"$$$","requires":["plates"],"substitutes":["landmine","shoulderpress"],"signature_exercises":["Viking press","Viking push press","Landmine viking press"],"exercise_ids":[],"buying_tips":"A landmine with a viking handle attachment is the space-saving option.","safety":"Lock your trunk so you don't over-arch the lower back.","group_order":9,"sort_order":21},{"id":"yoke","name":"Yoke","aliases":["Strongman yoke","Super yoke","Yoke bar"],"keywords":"yoke carry walk strongman","category":"Strongman","subcategory":"Carry implements","app_group":"Strongman","tier":3,"setting":"both","description":"A tall steel frame with a crossbar that sits across your upper back; you load it with plates and walk with it.","muscle_focus":["Upper back","Core","Quads","Glutes"],"loading":"Plate loaded","weight_options":"Frame 45–100 kg (100–220 lb); loaded 150–500+ kg","adjustability":"Fixed frame; many have adjustable crossbar height. Some double as a squat stand.","footprint":{"length_cm":150,"width_cm":120,"height_cm":170},"space":"L","price_band":"$$$","requires":["plates"],"substitutes":["ssb","barbell"],"signature_exercises":["Yoke carry","Yoke walk for distance","Yoke pick and hold","Yoke squat"],"exercise_ids":["yoke"],"buying_tips":"Check crossbar height adjustment and whether it converts to a rack; wide feet reduce wobble.","safety":"Practise drops and keep the run path clear before loading heavy.","group_order":9,"sort_order":22},{"id":"gloves","name":"Boxing gloves","aliases":["Bag gloves","Sparring gloves","Training gloves","Muay Thai gloves"],"keywords":"boxing gloves","category":"Combat","subcategory":"Protective gear","app_group":"Combat","tier":1,"setting":"both","description":"Padded gloves that protect your hands (and partners) on bags, pads and in sparring.","muscle_focus":[],"loading":"None (support/tool)","weight_options":"8–20 oz; 12–16 oz most common","adjustability":"Lace-up or hook-and-loop.","footprint":null,"space":